1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:00,825
Can you swallow

2
00:00:00,825 --> 00:00:01,585
and breathe in

3
00:00:01,585 --> 00:00:02,890
at the same time?

4
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:03,820
Try it.

5
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:04,933
Can't, right?

6
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:06,051
Your spit just cut

7
00:00:06,051 --> 00:00:07,080
in line.

8
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,430
One tunnel.

9
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:09,700
Feel your throat jump?

10
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,110
That's your voice box,

11
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:12,830
hopping up under a lid.

12
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:14,273
Your brain hits PAUSE

13
00:00:14,273 --> 00:00:15,249
on breathing,

14
00:00:15,249 --> 00:00:16,040
and the lid

15
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,300
slams SHUT.

16
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:19,191
Ever had water

17
00:00:19,191 --> 00:00:20,967
go down the wrong pipe?

18
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:21,800
The lid

19
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,833
was LATE.

20
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:24,734
You stop breathing

21
00:00:24,734 --> 00:00:25,680
like this

22
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,561
HUNDREDS

23
00:00:26,561 --> 00:00:27,920
of times a day...

24
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,367
without thinking.

25
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,075
Now you're thinking

26
00:00:30,075 --> 00:00:31,030
about it.

27
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,250
Sorry.

